  "method": "Two single-arm runs on existing staging, three fresh implicit NEAR wallets each, on the accepted backend with the concurrent Deriver dispatch. Run one wrapped the unchanged Router, Deriver A, Deriver B and Signing Worker builds so that every Worker and wallet-object invocation reported its Cloudflare location and server from an outbound trace request. Run two wrapped only the Router: each registration execution created two storage-free objects in the Router wallet namespace, one by unique ID and one by name, and later Router invocations for the same wallet timed their first and second call to each. Database primaries come from the D1 query metadata. Staging was restored after each run.",
